[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/298428138","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/6689#issuecomment-298428138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/6689","id":298428138,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5ODQyODEzOA==","user":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-01T20:46:47Z","updated_at":"2017-05-01T20:46:47Z","body":"Can you please open a PR and add a unit-test as well ?\n\n\nOn 1. May 2017 at 13:45:41, mskaric (notifications@github.com) wrote:\n\nThere is a problem in condition. Please remove ! sign.\nExpected behavior\n\nString contentEncoding =\nheaders.headers().get(HttpHeaderNames.CONTENT_ENCODING);\nif (contentEncoding != null &&\nHttpHeaderValues.IDENTITY.contentEqualsIgnoreCase(contentEncoding)) {\nreturn null;\n}\nActual behavior\n\nString contentEncoding =\nheaders.headers().get(HttpHeaderNames.CONTENT_ENCODING);\nif (contentEncoding != null &&\n!HttpHeaderValues.IDENTITY.contentEqualsIgnoreCase(contentEncoding)) {\nreturn null;\n}\nSteps to reproduce Minimal yet complete reproducer code (or URL to code) Netty\nversion JVM version (e.g. java -version) OS version (e.g. uname -a)\n\n—\nYou are receiving this because you are subscribed to this thread.\nReply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\n<https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/6689>, or mute the thread\n<https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AAa0Qhfn52-kMUKOieYJZUOmgbX6vuhYks5r1kR0gaJpZM4NNays>\n.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/298428138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/298430288","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/6689#issuecomment-298430288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/6689","id":298430288,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5ODQzMDI4OA==","user":{"login":"mskaric","id":28273692,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MjczNjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28273692?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric","html_url":"https://github.com/mskaric","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-01T20:56:02Z","updated_at":"2017-05-01T20:56:02Z","body":"Unfortunately I really have no time to delve into that :). I just wanted to\nhelp. I made this code to go around the problem and now it works as\nexpected. Hopefully you don't mind.\nSetting identity should turn off the compression e.g. return null.\n\n\npublic class WebContentCompressor extends HttpContentCompressor{\n\n    @Override\n    protected Result beginEncode(HttpResponse headers, String\nacceptEncoding) throws Exception {\n        String\nencoding=headers.headers().get(HttpHeaderNames.CONTENT_ENCODING);\n        if(encoding!=null &&\nHttpHeaderValues.IDENTITY.contentEqualsIgnoreCase(encoding))\n              return null;\n        return super.beginEncode(headers, acceptEncoding);\n    }\n\n}\n\n\nSrdačan pozdrav,\n\n*Milan*\n\nOn Mon, May 1, 2017 at 10:47 PM, Norman Maurer <notifications@github.com>\nwrote:\n\n> Can you please open a PR and add a unit-test as well ?\n>\n>\n> On 1. May 2017 at 13:45:41, mskaric (notifications@github.com) wrote:\n>\n> There is a problem in condition. Please remove ! sign.\n> Expected behavior\n>\n> String contentEncoding =\n> headers.headers().get(HttpHeaderNames.CONTENT_ENCODING);\n> if (contentEncoding != null &&\n> HttpHeaderValues.IDENTITY.contentEqualsIgnoreCase(contentEncoding)) {\n> return null;\n> }\n> Actual behavior\n>\n> String contentEncoding =\n> headers.headers().get(HttpHeaderNames.CONTENT_ENCODING);\n> if (contentEncoding != null &&\n> !HttpHeaderValues.IDENTITY.contentEqualsIgnoreCase(contentEncoding)) {\n> return null;\n> }\n> Steps to reproduce Minimal yet complete reproducer code (or URL to code)\n> Netty\n> version JVM version (e.g. java -version) OS version (e.g. uname -a)\n>\n> —\n> You are receiving this because you are subscribed to this thread.\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\n> <https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/6689>, or mute the thread\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AAa0Qhfn52-\n> kMUKOieYJZUOmgbX6vuhYks5r1kR0gaJpZM4NNays>\n> .\n>\n> —\n> You are receiving this because you authored the thread.\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\n> <https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/6689#issuecomment-298428138>, or mute\n> the thread\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/Aa9sHIdjVNl7WsIoXOZjNrPvSVKojIBPks5r1kTOgaJpZM4NNays>\n> .\n>\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/298430288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mskaric","id":28273692,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MjczNjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28273692?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric","html_url":"https://github.com/mskaric","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mskaric/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/us